NOTICE — Fan Project Disclaimer
================================

This project ("以撒的结合 · 网页复刻版" / isaac-roguelike) is an unofficial,
non-commercial fan project created for the purpose of studying procedural
graphics generation and roguelike level-generation algorithms.

It is NOT affiliated with, authorized by, endorsed by, sponsored by, or in any
way officially connected with Edmund McMillen, Nicalis, Inc., or any entity
involved in the development or publication of "The Binding of Isaac".

"The Binding of Isaac" and all associated names, characters, and setting
elements are trademarks and/or property of their respective owners. This
project independently reimplements *gameplay mechanics* only.

No assets from the original game are included in this repository:

  * Every graphic is drawn procedurally in code at runtime (see src/gfx.js,
    src/sprites.js, src/tiles.js). There are no image files.
  * Every sound effect and the background music are synthesized at runtime via
    the Web Audio API (see src/audio.js). There are no audio files.

